+### A lesson nobody joined
+
+`mv-lesson-no-joins` (every five minutes) files one task in the room's pool
+for a confirmed online lesson 10–30 minutes past its start, in a room that is
+on, that the student has not joined ("Student has not joined the online
+lesson"), or that the student is waiting in and nobody else has opened
+("Teacher has not joined the online lesson"). Once per session, ever: the
+sweep remembers in `lesson_events` (kind `no_join_task`, payload
+`{task_id, note}`), so a task marked done is not filed again. Nothing is filed
+for a room that is off, an in-person booking, a held or cancelled booking, or
+a session with no department (no pool to wait in). The task is news, so the
+pool's push goes out as it does for a handover.
